<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Sept oil products imports by countries.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Sept oil products imports by countries.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's oil products imports by countries: (Korea Petroleum Development Corp, in 1,000 barrels)</p>
<p> Major suppliers    Sept	   Aug	   Sept 1995</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia	 3,532	 4,234	    4,557</p>
<p> Kuwait		 1,719	 2,826	    2,104</p>
<p> Japan		    713	 1,414	    2,153</p>
<p> Singapore	    2,061	 1,172	    1,388</p>
<p> U.S.		     748	   797		862</p>
<p> Europe/Africa	  455	   516		 -</p>
<p> TOTAL		 14,475	14,874	   15,572</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
